# Studio schemas & `scripts/`

- **Registered types:** `apps/studio/schemas/index.ts` exports `post`, `teamMember`, `gallery`, `product`, `legalPage`, `siteSettings`. Sidebar order comes from `structure.ts`.
- **Parity:** each content document type maps to a Content Collection listed in `apps/web/src/content.config.ts`. Field renames/new required fields require updates in `apps/web/src/lib/sanity/queries.ts`, `transforms.ts`, `types.ts`, and `apps/web/src/lib/data.ts`.
- **`siteSettings`:** not migrated by `scripts/migrate-to-sanity.ts`; create/configure in Studio if `Seo.astro` should resolve defaults.
- **Migration:** `scripts/migrate-to-sanity.ts` uses `@sanity/client`, `gray-matter`, `dotenv`, reads `apps/web/.env` for `SANITY_PROJECT_ID`, expects `SANITY_TOKEN` or `SANITY_WRITE_TOKEN`. `SEED_ALL=1` (via `pnpm seed:all`) triggers delete-then-migrate behavior — read the script before changing batching or types.
- **Root scripts:** only `migrate` and `seed:all` are wired in root `package.json`; other `scripts/*.ts` utilities are manual.

Do not add Studio plugins in docs unless they appear in `apps/studio/sanity.config.ts`.
